// Bandit Level 3 → Level 4

URL: https://overthewire.org/wargames/bandit/

Step1: Log in to the Bandit Level 3 server using SSH:

        ssh bandit3@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step2: Enter the password obtained from Bandit Level 2.

Step3: List the files in the current directory:

        ls

Step4: The directory `inhere` is present. Enter the directory:

        cd inhere

Step5: List all files, including hidden files:

        ls -la

Step6: A hidden file named `.hidden` is present.

Step7: Read the contents of the hidden file:

        cat .hidden

Step8: The output is the password required to log in to the next level, `bandit4`.

Step9: Use the obtained password to connect to the next level:

        ssh bandit4@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step10: The Bandit Level 3 → Level 4 challenge is solved.

Step11: Congratulations!! you have solved this problem!!
